# Non-deployed lockfiles — Dependabot scanned these and raised alerts against
# code that is never built or served. The app deploys from the ROOT
# package-lock.json (Dockerfile runs `npm ci` at /app, which carries every
# backend dep), so these only produced noise + a stale-dependency trap.
#   - backend/package-lock.json: vestigial; root install is authoritative.
#   - */frontend-handoff/package-lock.json: generated snapshots (npm run handoff:frontends).
backend/package-lock.json
**/frontend-handoff/package-lock.json
